   --> case.nvs:46:21
%A
error[E0735]: the `#[Fixture]` method `notPublic` is not `public`
   --> case.nvs:52:29
%A
error[E0735]: the `#[Fixture]` method `suppliesNothing` returns `void`
   --> case.nvs:58:28
%A
error[E0454]: `name` is not an option of `#[Fixture]`
   --> case.nvs:63:15
%A
error[E0735]: the `#[Fixture]` method `bothAtOnce` is also a `#[Test]`
   --> case.nvs:72:28
%A
error[E0304]: `TwiceTest` declares two `#[Fixture]` methods returning `Schema`
   --> case.nvs:86:28
